    "Gross profit is net sales minus booked COGS. GP % is shown when net sales are positive. Actual COGS requires complete verified inventory cost evidence that matches booked COGS. Gross profit excludes the separately posted FET expense and internal delivery expenses." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "毛利为净销售额减去账面销售成本。净销售额为正时显示毛利率。实际销售成本要求完整、已验证的库存成本依据，且与账面销售成本一致。毛利不扣除单独过账的 FET 费用及内部配送费用。"
